# Place the per-platform `qpdf` binary here to bundle it with the app.
#
# Expected layout (see src-tauri/src/pdf_engine/qpdf.rs for resolution order):
#   binaries/qpdf            (macOS / Linux)
#   binaries/qpdf.exe        (Windows)
#   binaries/<dlls...>       (Windows runtime DLLs qpdf needs, if any)
#
# These are intentionally NOT committed (see .gitignore). At runtime the app
# first looks for a bundled binary in this folder (copied into app resources),
# then falls back to `qpdf` on the system PATH. See README "PDF engine".
